.TH RFID-RECORD-30S 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-record-30s \- record or play a bounded Jabra clip for an RFID card
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-record-30s
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Records a bounded Jabra microphone clip for the current or provided RFID card,
trims silence, archives a WAV file plus metadata, and can play the latest clip
for that card. Preserved clips are local recording archive data.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --action " record|play"
Record a new clip or play the latest stored clip.
.TP
.BI --card " CARD"
Card ID. Defaults to RFID mode environment or latest scan.
.TP
.BI --seconds " SECONDS"
Recording length. The default is 30.
.TP
.BI --archive-dir " DIR"
Persistent archive root.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Show intended playback without playing audio when supported.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-voice-memo (1),
.BR jabra-recorded-time (1)
